<title>USA: BIG Entertainment Feb same store sales up.</title>
<headline>BIG Entertainment Feb same store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>BIG Entertainment Inc said on Tuesday that preliminary results from its entertainment super-kiosk retail division show same-store sales rose by 12.2 percent in February compared with the year-ago month.</p>
<p>The company did not provide specific figures and could not be reached immediately for more information.</p>
<p>It said retail sales for all stores for February rose 101 percent from retail sales for February, 1996.</p>
</text>
